mittleff Release Notes
=======================

Version 0.1 (Pre-release) - 2026-01-14
--------------------------------------

Initial pre-release version.

Features:
- Basic utility library with hello() function
- Shared and static library builds
- pkg-config support
- Symbol visibility control
- Namespaced header installation (mittleff/mittleff.h)

Notes:
- This is a pre-release version (0.x)
- API may change in future versions
- Not recommended for production use yet
